    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm new to management here and just wanted to get a quick breakdown of how our progressive discipline policy actually works? like, what's the general flow from a first issue to someone getting let go? just wanna make sure i'm following the right steps for documentation. thanks",
