      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sure! Our progressive discipline policy usually begins with a verbal warning when a first offense occurs. If the behavior persists, it escalates to a written warning, then a suspension, and finally, termination if there are other serious violations or repeated issues. It's important to document each step taken, the employee's acknowledgement of the behavior, and any training or warning provided. I suggest using a consistent template for all records. Let me know if you need assistance in drafting such templates.",
